              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cam 11.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I dog oro ma en aye kare ma luker gicito kwede ka mony, Joab ocako telo wi mony, guneko lobo pa jo Ammon woko, ka dok gubino gurumo gaŋ Raba. Ento Daudi yam odon i Jerucalem. Joab olwenyo i kom Raba, ci oloyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Daudi okwanyo lalukana me jabu ki i wi kabakagi; pekke romo ratili miya acel, got me wei bene onoŋo tye iye. Ci gicibo i wi Daudi. Dok okelo jami ma giyako i gaŋ meno madwoŋ twatwal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok okelo jo ma giyakogi ki i gaŋ meno, ci oketogi ka tic ki mucumeno ki cururu nyonyo ki latoŋ-gu, Daudi obedo ka timo jo ma i gaŋi pa jo Ammon ducu kit meno. Ci Daudi ki lwak ducu gucako dok cen wa i Jerucalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lacen lweny dok ocakke i kom jo Piliciti ma i Gejer; ci Cibekai ma Lakucat oneko Cipai woko, ma onoŋo en ŋat acel ma i kin likwayo pa twon oluma-ni; yam giloyo jo, Piliciti kit meno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.17.4+1SA.17.5+1SA.17.6+1SA.17.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Cam 17.4-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka lweny dok ocakke i kom jo Piliciti; ci Elkanan wod pa Jair oneko Lami ma omin Goliac ma jo Gat, ma bol toŋŋe rom ki rii yat lacwe boŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lweny dok obedo i Gat ka ma tye iye dano mo ma oputte mabor liwawo, ma tye ki nyig ciŋe abicel, ki nyig tyene bene abicel, tuŋ ryoryo ducu, ci nyig Lwete ducu romo pyeraryo wiye aŋwen; en bene yam lakwar twoni oluma-nu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka okatti ka nywaro jo Icrael ‘ki ŋala, ci Yonacan wod pa Cimea ma omin Daudi oneko en woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo man gin likwayo pa twoni oluma ma i Gat; gin ducu Daudi kacel ki luticce gutyekogi woko,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
